    "definition_raw": "You snipe quickly, making it harder for others to find the location of your attack.   Prerequisites: Stealth 1 rank, kobold. Benefit: When you are sniping, you only take a –10 penalty on your Stealth checks to stay hidden. Normal: You take a –20 penalty on your Stealth check to maintain your obscured location while sniping.",
